Summary:
During today’s session, the focus was entirely on revising core React concepts to strengthen foundational understanding. Key topics such as components, props, state management, and event handling were reviewed in detail. Additional attention was given to understanding the component lifecycle and how React manages rendering. Practice exercises were also done to reinforce these concepts and improve clarity.

Outcomes:
By the end of the session, there was a clearer and more confident understanding of essential React concepts. The revision helped in improving the ability to structure components and manage state effectively. It also enhanced understanding of how React handles updates and user interactions. Overall, the session contributed to building a stronger foundation in React for future development.
